{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"44ebec9d2006e18fcbce81e6c10814aa38904ba3d1c22d537ff051560b648bd7","ja":"ううっ……。\nも、もう無理かも……。","zh":"呜呜……。\n可、可能已经不行了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"bef2d80177d2a1e2f562f42675e02f0e72cf7e6602159fefc5c4513e2033050e","ja":"ここまでは、すごく良くなりましたね。\nそれじゃあ、次のシーンを……。","zh":"到这里，已经变得非常好了呢。\n那么，接下来是下一个场景……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d5564e1fdcaafddfdd2f0502c306942ac10536c82a528a5b936e1f739c56563e","ja":"ええっ、まだやるの！？\n真美、もうへとへとだよ……。","zh":"诶，还要继续吗！？\n真美已经累得不行了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b8a59c997f428a15a16211a74632e49135e0ff68fb1c7418faa0454df840c8e8","ja":"そ、それに次のシーンは別の女性も登場するから、\n真美ちゃんとふたりじゃ……。","zh":"而、而且下一个场景还会有别的女性登场，只有真美和我两个人的话……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cc424521d6c2724fe30f89f9e3fdc0283b1ca57827989db66908888cfce86482","ja":"大丈夫です、もうひとりの女性役は私がやりますから！\nさあ、このままの調子でいきましょう！","zh":"没关系，另一个女性角色由我来演！\n来，就照这个势头继续吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d6fa4984104299be3cafd49bb9e2d592db2eafeb42635c8299f646f0cd0f79fe","ja":"……あれ？　レッスンルームから声が聞こえる。\n誰か練習でもしてるのかな～？","zh":"……咦？从练习室里传来了声音。\n是谁在练习吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2cfbb230245f6d2684497da597a368e32f284c9623bc5db6bc9b1cf1f05b8ed4","ja":"えっ……ええ～～～！？ 　莉緒さんと琴葉ちゃんが、\n真美ちゃんを取り合ってる……。ど、どういうこと？","zh":"诶……诶诶～～～！？ 莉绪姐和琴叶，  \n正在争夺真美……这、这是怎么回事？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3d38f1293d23ad9ba1d7b00bcb0ce6542eaa9bf815df98399dfe2684a782c565","ja":"あ、雪歩ちゃん、ちょうどよかったわ。\n雪歩ちゃんも一緒に……。","zh":"啊，雪步，来得正好。  \n雪步也一起……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"421e01a0ec8d4860b67ad4f5c6ea4f680ea8fa3fffdaffdb7e8aeade83fb0bfb","ja":"えっ？　わ、私もって……。\nむ、無理ですぅ～。ご、ごめんなさ～い！","zh":"诶？我、我也要……？\n不、不行啦～。对、对不起～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_920.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"89fb8d647d5c8aca01b72de8159c7776a081404b974ba45e821b10d31f4eefb5","ja":"えっ……？\n雪歩ちゃん、いったいどうしたの……？","zh":"咦……？\n雪步，你到底怎么了……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
